@startuml
title BizAgent hub-and-spoke (sample)
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Operator
component "Web UI\n(control-plane)" as UI
component "Hub PTL" as Hub
component "Product agents" as Agents
database "library/\n(plans + .puml)" as Lib
database "Mail\ninbox/outbox" as Mail

Operator --> UI : chat / Library
UI --> Hub : turns
Hub --> Mail : route
Mail --> Agents
Agents --> Mail : replies
Hub --> Lib : write .md / .puml
Operator --> Lib : click entry\n→ rendered diagram

note right of Lib
  Agents generate PlantUML,
  register in library/manifest.json.
  Library click renders SVG via plantuml.sh.
end note
@enduml
